  "ingredients": [
    "3 cups graham cracker crumbs",
    "0.5 cup butter, melted",
    "1 tablespoon confectioners' sugar",
    "1 (3 ounce) package lemon flavored Jell-O® mix",
    "1 cup boiling water",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 (5 ounce) can evaporated milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MdE-cLzEeFbph-BLdmCs372QSQ4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17980-no-bake-lemon-cheesecake-VAT-001-step-01-26bd44d16a2a4e5fb82928c3e4ed593d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17980/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place graham cracker crumbs, butter, and confectioners' sugar in a medium bowl; mix well to combine and press into the bottom of a 10-inch springform pan. Bake in preheated oven for 10 minutes. Remove from oven and allow to cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/klMCXqJxN7vA5DfpykXw2f5LHDI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17980-no-bake-lemon-cheesecake-VAT-003-step-02-2-488a44ff1012423aa2e9299af1a48fd9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17980/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dissolve lemon gelatin in boiling water. Let cool until thick, but not set.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XO9dZTwfyvdpXy1n-uAGlDBbqb8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17980-no-bake-lemon-cheesecake-VAT-004-step-03-e34a7eb9500f407ba39feb3f67828db4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17980/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat cream cheese, white sugar, and vanilla together in a bowl until smooth. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_qkVCo284gsya6C1gKFSgeSHiWQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17980-no-bake-lemon-cheesecake-VAT-005-step-04-0198aea6091e41019f102d4ade9b0e1f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17980/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whip evaporated milk in a separate bowl until thick and stiff peaks form. Pour in cooled lemon gelatin and keep mixing until well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zaUdytIEEHpJMiPVoyfZYurgHM0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17980-no-bake-lemon-cheesecake-VAT-006-step-05-44fffa5e162246e18b73b3fe789318d1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17980/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold in cream cheese mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MWFOLqLrXsm-4rIp21GX8D_gfD4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17980-no-bake-lemon-cheesecake-VAT-007-step-06-26e255e2cfb94c38b0985830acf42eb5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/17980/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour filling into crust. Chill in refrigerator for at least 3 hours before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
